            <div xml:id="d235">

                <pb facs="0352" n="240" xml:id="pg240"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 818.00/330</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Costa Rica</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Johnson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Port Limon</hi></placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-02-24"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >undated</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received
                            February 24, 1918, 8.07 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Other factions movement have cut railway Limon; communication difficult; none by
                    cable. Movement growing.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
